5. Pursae Web Builder (web/web-builder, builder/)
-------------------------------------------------
web/web-builder/ is built by builder/scripts/build.mjs from builder/host (Pursae, GPLv2 or later)
and builder/upstream, a git submodule of https://github.com/pursae/Builder pinned in
builder/UPSTREAM_SHA, patched with builder/patches/*.patch (Pursae). The bundled npm packages —
React and ReactDOM 19.3.1 and scheduler 0.28.0 (MIT, Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates),
Motion / Framer Motion 14.9.0 with motion-dom and motion-utils (MIT, Motion B.V. and Framer B.V.),
lucide-react 1.66.0 (ISC, Lucide Icons and Contributors; includes Feather icons, MIT), tslib
2.9.1 (0BSD, Microsoft Corporation), Tailwind CSS 4.3.3 generated CSS (MIT, Tailwind Labs, Inc.)
and the Fontsource 5.3.0 packages of Inter, Space Grotesk, JetBrains Mono and Instrument Serif
(OFL-1.1, see section 4) — have their notices reproduced in full in
web/web-builder/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt, which the build writes (scripts/licenses.mjs) and
`make builder-test` checks.

pursae/Builder carries no license file of its own (its package.json is the "figma-make-app"
template, private: true); see the project's licensing notes before redistributing it separately.


